( Architecture Report: Oman Legal GraphRAG Pipeline) Tj T*
() Tj T*
( Executive Summary) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This project builds an end-to-end GraphRAG pipeline for Omani legal documents from) Tj T*
(qanoon.om, with English translations from decree.om when they are linked from the Arabic) Tj T*
(source page. The implementation favors deterministic extraction over unnecessary LLM calls.) Tj T*
(The crawler uses WordPress REST endpoints when available, stores resumable state in SQLite,) Tj T*
(serializes content to Markdown, loads consolidated multilingual Document nodes into Neo4j,) Tj T*
(extracts topics, creates semantic chunks, embeds topics and chunks, and exposes a hybrid) Tj T*
(search client with both local JSONL and live Neo4j backends.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The implementation is designed to be practical and reproducible: complete enough to run end) Tj T*
(to end, but intentionally avoids overbuilding speculative infrastructure. The strongest) Tj T*
(engineering choices are the REST-first crawl gate, exact parsing of site-provided metadata,) Tj T*
(deterministic legal edge extraction, and a runnable sample dataset.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
( Crawling And Serialization) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The first command checks qanoon.om/wp-json/wp/v2/posts?per_page=1 and decree.om/wp-) Tj T*
(json/wp/v2/posts?per_page=1. If both return JSON objects with id, the crawler uses WordPress) Tj T*
(REST pagination. If either endpoint fails, sitemap fallback is available. This avoids) Tj T*
(expensive browser automation for the normal case while still preserving a recovery route.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The crawler includes practical robustness controls: rotating user agents, randomized pacing,) Tj T*
(retries with exponential backoff, Retry-After handling, optional proxy configuration, and) Tj T*
(persistent cookie storage. An optional Playwright detail-page fallback is available when) Tj T*
(direct HTTP fetches fail, but the primary path remains the public REST API. The) Tj T*
(implementation does not claim CAPTCHA solving, TLS fingerprint spoofing, or proxy-pool) Tj T*
(evasion.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Qanoon remains the source of truth. The crawler does not derive decree.om URLs from qanoon) Tj T*
(slugs because the live site has inconsistent zero padding and different patterns for non-) Tj T*
(royal-decree documents. Instead, it extracts the embedded English link directly from each) Tj T*
(Arabic post and follows that exact URL.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Official gazette posts such as og1649 are treated as index pages. They are useful for) Tj T*
(discovering linked decrees and decisions, but they are not ingested as root Document nodes) Tj T*
(because they duplicate or aggregate content without being a full legal text.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(HTML is converted to Markdown with scripts, style tags, tracking markup, and layout noise) Tj T*
(removed. PyMuPDF is included as a PDF fallback for documents where HTML is absent or too) Tj T*
(thin. Arabic PDF extraction is treated as a known risk because right-to-left text,) Tj T*
(ligatures, and encoding can degrade quality.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
( Metadata And Graph Modeling) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The graph schema keeps each legal instrument consolidated:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- Document stores Arabic and English Markdown as contentAr and contentEn.) Tj T*
(- Chunk stores semantic text windows linked by HAS_CHUNK.) Tj T*
(- Topic stores extracted legal concepts linked by HAS_TOPIC.) Tj T*
(- Legal cross-document edges are REFERENCES, REPEALS, and AMENDS.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Primary document numbers are parsed from the specific paragraph immediately below h1.entry-) Tj T*
(title, which contains all four formats such as 2026/60 60/2026 ????/?? ??/????. The parser) Tj T*
(does not scan the body for primary numbers, because legal body text contains many referenced) Tj T*
(decree numbers.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
